al_business_count":0},{"category":"Shopping","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","review_id":"0eIS1toHPv5V8cu5ENl3Qw","date":"2017-12-01T02:08:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9424821138381958,"text_excerpt":"I always enjoy a trip through the French Market. The history of the market is rich, and if you're born and raised in NOLA, chances are that you have ancestors who've worked in the market in some respect. I love the silver jewelry, tchotchkes from far away places, inexpensive voodoo dolls and Mardi Gras beads, cheap sunglasses, scarves, purses, and tons of other cool things. I'm also loving the crepe cart - delicious crepes and you can watch them being made. There's a great Smoothie stop in addition to several other healthy meal options if you've been overdoing it on the food front while hanging out in the city. I so appreciate lighter choices. And oysters on the half shell! I haven't trie..."},{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","review_id":"htlYSR1qzcZgQKGJ7fF8WA","date":"2012-09-03T05:58:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9397395849227905,"text_excerpt":"The French Market is a must-see when in NOLA. Obviously, this is a touristy spot so if you're looking for some souvenirs to take home, this is one good place to start looking. So far, I picked up the standard \"I Love NOLA\" shirts to give to family back home, a beautiful pair of silver fleur de lis earrings, and beads that still make my friends think I did the Bourbon Street way of earning them. There are also alligator knickknacks, voodoo dolls, and other interesting trinkets. Aside from the flea market, there is also a farmer's market. I have not had a chance to buy anything from them but I remember thinking to myself that it is a good place to go to when fiber and vitamins need to be in..."},{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","review_id":"PUyPGvAkKbb7xyoNvncwPw","date":"2014-12-17T21:38:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9368802309036255,"text_excerpt":"The French Market... a truly wonderful experience. You want thingamabobs, they got at least 20. This is a most go for me every time I visit NOLA. It's an outside shopping area that has so much to see. I definitely would suggest good walking shoes and also go when the weather is nice. The vast majority of it is covered but you have to walk through uncovered streets to get to it. Cash is another great suggestion, as well as, your camera and an appetite.. as there's a couple food stalls you'll want to hit up. These food stalls include alligator everything, smoothie shops, roasted corn, and an oyster shucker...just to name a few. There's trinkets and trumpets, bobbles and bangles galore, and ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","photo_id":"NMl0Dpc3T31bUv8nvdMZ5A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/NMl0Dpc3T31bUv8nvdMZ5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8938673734664917},{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","photo_id":"XyM_VXRyT6PHD7venXcWiQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/XyM_VXRyT6PHD7venXcWiQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8373758792877197},{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","photo_id":"r6Av9Cz0nyrAzoMrIDC2Nw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/r6Av9Cz0nyrAzoMrIDC2Nw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8288390040397644},{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","photo_id":"cVzVpsHSmPy0UVj3Pk5kEw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/cVzVpsHSmPy0UVj3Pk5kEw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.711922824382782},{"business_id":"-xaY1TlMf20Ol9QLcDSU6Q","photo_id":"ybykWG5wpqi1ukaRYT_AUg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ybykWG5wpqi1ukaRYT_AUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7103232145309448}]},"notebook_case":null}
